{"seq":1,"slug":"connectivity-graph","title":"连接图：把整座建筑当成一张图来算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-building-construction-systems/structure/connectivity-graph","wordCount":1727,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"连接图-把整座建筑当成一张图来算\">连接图：把整座建筑当成一张图来算</h1><p>玩家拆掉一栋楼底层的一根柱子，上面三层「哗」地全塌下来；玩家用围墙圈出一块地，系统识别出这是一个封闭的房间并开始判定屋内温度。这两件事看起来毫不相关，其实是同一个数据结构在支撑：把每个部件当节点、每处连接当边的<strong>连接图</strong>。这一篇讲这张图怎么建、怎么维护、以及在它上面能跑哪些查询。它是 <a href=\"structural-integrity\">结构稳定性</a> 的前置——稳定性传播就在这张图上跑；数据来自 <a href=\"../foundations/building-model\">数据模型</a> 里吸附点的 <code>occupiedBy</code> 字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>连接图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是建造系统的结构骨架：节点是实例，边是连接。围绕它有三个层层递进的术语：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连接图</td>\n<td>实例为点、连接为边的无向图</td>\n<td>一切结构查询的底座</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连通分量</td>\n<td>图中互相可达的节点集合</td>\n<td>一栋建筑 = 一个分量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对偶图</td>\n<td>以「空腔」为节点的补图</td>\n<td>房间/室内判定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键洞察在于：<strong>建筑的「实体连接」和「空间围合」是同一张图的相互对偶面</strong>——连接图算实体怎么连，对偶图算围合出的空腔怎么连。而整篇的性能命题只有一个：这张图必须<strong>局部增量维护</strong>，因为玩家的每次操作只影响一两个节点及其邻居。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图的定义-节点-边与它们的来源\">图的定义：节点、边与它们的来源</h2><p>连接图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是所有已放置实例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是它们之间的连接关系。边从哪来，取决于范式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>吸附范式</strong>：一条边就是一对互填的 <code>occupiedBy</code>——放置对齐时把双方吸附点连上，边天然产生，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 建立。</li>\n<li><strong>网格范式</strong>：边是隐式的邻接——两块占据相邻格子且接触面兼容，就算连接。可以不显式存边，查询时按格坐标现算六个邻居。</li>\n<li><strong>自由范式</strong>：最麻烦，边靠运行时几何邻接查询近似（两块接触面积超阈值算连），代价高，这也是自由范式少做结构分析的原因（见 <a href=\"../foundations/building-paradigms\">建造范式</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>边通常带权或带类型：结构承重边（地基-墙）和纯装饰边（挂在墙上的火把）要区分，因为稳定性只关心承重边。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连通分量-一栋楼是哪些部件\">连通分量：一栋楼是哪些部件</h2><p>最基础的查询是「这些部件里哪些属于同一栋建筑」——即图的连通分量。玩家频繁地拆、接、合并，如果每次都全图跑一遍 DFS/BFS 找连通分量，大基地会卡。正确工具是<strong>并查集</strong>（union-find / 不相交集）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>放置并连接两块：<code>union(a, b)</code>，把两栋合并成一栋，近乎 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（按秩合并 + 路径压缩，均摊 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\alpha(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是反阿克曼函数，实际上是常数）。</li>\n<li>查某块属于哪栋：<code>find(x)</code>，返回根，即建筑 ID。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>并查集的短板是不擅长<strong>删除</strong>——拆掉一块可能把一栋楼劈成两半，而并查集无法高效「分裂」。工程上常见两种应对：拆除时对受影响的局部子图做一次增量 BFS 重新标记连通分量（大多数拆除只影响少量部件）；或者维护显式邻接表，删除后从被删节点的邻居各发起一次洪泛，看它们是否还能到达地基。选哪种取决于拆除频率与建筑规模。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[放置并对齐两块] --&gt; B[union 合并连通分量]&#10;  C[查询某块所属建筑] --&gt; D[find 返回根 ID]&#10;  E[拆除某块] --&gt; F{可能劈裂建筑?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[受影响子图&lt;br/&gt;增量 BFS 重标连通分量]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[仅移除节点与边]&#10;  G --&gt; I[对每个新分量重新判定支撑]\">graph TD\n  A[放置并对齐两块] --&gt; B[union 合并连通分量]\n  C[查询某块所属建筑] --&gt; D[find 返回根 ID]\n  E[拆除某块] --&gt; F{可能劈裂建筑?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[受影响子图&lt;br/&gt;增量 BFS 重标连通分量]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[仅移除节点与边]\n  G --&gt; I[对每个新分量重新判定支撑]</pre><h2 id=\"房间检测-连接图的对偶\">房间检测：连接图的对偶</h2><p>围墙围出的「房间」是很多建造游戏的关键概念——判定室内/室外、温度、通风、装饰评分（《英灵神殿》的舒适度、《层层恐惧》式的封闭判定）。房间检测本质是<strong>空间的洪泛填充</strong>：从一个空格出发在「未被墙阻断的」相邻空格间 BFS，若填充被墙完全包围、没漏到室外，就是一个封闭房间。</p>\n<p>它和连接图是对偶关系——连接图关注「实体部件怎么连」，房间检测关注「部件围出的空腔怎么连」。实现上网格范式最自然：把世界看成格子，墙格是障碍，对空气格做连通分量分析，触及地图边界的分量是「室外」，其余封闭分量各是一个房间。这个洪泛的思路和 <a href=\"../../game-fog-of-war-visibility/foundations/visibility-problem\">雾与可见性</a> 里的可见区域扩散、以及寻路里的图搜索同源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三类查询的复杂度对照\">三类查询的复杂度对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>查询</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>数据结构</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>属于哪栋建筑</td>\n<td>拆整栋、算总价、批操作</td>\n<td>并查集</td>\n<td>均摊 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\alpha(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拆某块后谁失去支撑</td>\n<td>触发坍塌</td>\n<td>邻接表 + 局部 BFS</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>受影响子图</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\text{受影响子图})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">受影响子图</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否封闭房间</td>\n<td>室内判定、舒适度</td>\n<td>空气格连通分量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>空腔格数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\text{空腔格数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">空腔格数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到地基的最短支撑距离</td>\n<td>稳定性传播</td>\n<td>多源 BFS</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(V+E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行「到地基的最短支撑距离」正是 <a href=\"structural-integrity\">结构稳定性</a> 的核心运算，它把连接图和一个虚拟的「地面源点」一起做多源 BFS。连接图在这里从一个静态的数据结构，变成了力学模拟的输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增量维护是性能的关键\">增量维护是性能的关键</h2><p>连接图千万不能每帧或每次操作全量重建。玩家一次操作通常只影响一两块及其邻居，图的更新应当是<strong>局部增量</strong>的：放置只加一个节点和几条边并 <code>union</code>；拆除只删一个节点、断几条边、并对局部触发连通性复检。全量重算只在加载存档时发生一次。把「改动的影响范围」限制在局部，是让连接图在两万块部件的大基地上仍然流畅的根本，也和 <a href=\"../practice/building-performance\">性能与批处理</a> 里「只更新脏区域」的思想一致。为此，实例上通常缓存所属建筑 ID 和到地基的支撑距离，只有受影响的部件才标脏重算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>连接图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：节点是实例，边来自吸附范式的 <code>occupiedBy</code>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）、网格范式的隐式邻接、或自由范式的昂贵几何查询。</li>\n<li>连通分量用并查集维护，<code>union</code>/<code>find</code> 均摊近常数；短板是删除，靠受影响子图的局部 BFS 重标应对。</li>\n<li>房间检测是连接图的对偶——对空气格做连通分量，触及边界的是室外，封闭分量是房间。</li>\n<li>「到地基最短支撑距离」的多源 BFS 是稳定性传播的核心运算，把连接图变成力学输入。</li>\n<li>图必须局部增量维护、缓存建筑 ID 与支撑距离、只重算脏部件，全量重建仅在加载时发生。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>图的数据来源：<a href=\"../foundations/building-model\">数据模型</a>；图上的第一大应用：<a href=\"structural-integrity\">结构稳定性</a></li>\n<li>边的类型来自部件设计：<a href=\"piece-system\">部件系统</a></li>\n<li>跨库——图搜索与 BFS 的算法根基，见 <a href=\"../../pathfinding-navigation-mesh/foundations/search-graph-representation\">寻路·搜索图表示</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"连接图：把整座建筑当成一张图来算","id":"连接图-把整座建筑当成一张图来算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"图的定义：节点、边与它们的来源","id":"图的定义-节点-边与它们的来源"},{"level":2,"text":"连通分量：一栋楼是哪些部件","id":"连通分量-一栋楼是哪些部件"},{"level":2,"text":"房间检测：连接图的对偶","id":"房间检测-连接图的对偶"},{"level":2,"text":"三类查询的复杂度对照","id":"三类查询的复杂度对照"},{"level":2,"text":"增量维护是性能的关键","id":"增量维护是性能的关键"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"合法性规则：一条放置请求要过多少关","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-building-construction-systems/placement/validity-rules"},"next":{"title":"结构稳定性：让悬挑太远的建筑自己垮掉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-building-construction-systems/structure/structural-integrity"}}